Contributors to zpaq-std
========================

Maintainer
----------
- YadeWira (Yade Bravo) <https://github.com/YadeWira>
  Creator and maintainer of zpaq-std (YadeWira/zpaq-std): the bundled-compressors
  architecture (compressors/), the `-ma:algo:N` switch family and its ZPAQL
  decoders, the build (Makefile, Windows 7+ and 32-bit targets), the tests and the
  documentation.


Upstream lineage
----------------
- Matt Mahoney: author of zpaq 7.15 (2009-2016), the deduplicated journaling
  archiver at the root of the zpaq family, released into the public domain.
  <http://mattmahoney.net/dc/zpaq.html>
- Franco Corbelli: author of zpaqfranz, the fork of zpaq 7.15 that zpaq-std is
  forked from (zpaqfranz 65.4), MIT licence. Most of zpaq-std.cpp is his code;
  `zpaqfranz.cpp` was renamed `zpaq-std.cpp` in the fork.
  <https://github.com/fcorbelli/zpaqfranz>
  zpaqfranz's own credits for the code by other authors that it includes are in
  COPYING, and in zpaq-std.cpp.


